      "sourceRevision": "today-consumer-draft-2026-07-29",
      "translationStatus": "approved"
    },
    {
      "contentKey": "today.domain.love.neutral",
      "summary": "保持简单的连接",
      "detail": "今天的关系节奏比较平稳。及时回应、认真听完或留一点不被打扰的相处时间，比强行展开重大谈话更合适。",
      "sourceRevision": "today-consumer-draft-2026-07-29",
      "translationStatus": "approved"
    },
    {
